     A**
     A** EDI/NOI A49 Transmission File - PTD Segment
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A**
     A          R PT201                     TEXT('EDI A49 Format - PTD')
     A            T2CO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            T2EXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXTRACT DATE')
     A            T2TSET    R    3A         REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('TRANSACTION SET ID')
     A            T2MTC     R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINT TYPE CODE')
     A            T2TDT     R    8S 0       REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINT TYPE CODE DATE')
     A            T2JRST    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('JURISDICTION')
     A            T2ACLC    R   25A         REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADMIN' 'CLAIM' '#')
     A*
     A*  PTD/Reduced earnings/Recoveries (up to 25 occurrences)
     A*
     A            T2CODE         3          COLHDG('PTD Code')
     A            T2AMT         11  2       COLHDG('PTD Amount')
     A*
     A            T2STAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            T2USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            T2PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            T2TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            T2DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
